#: brikpanel.php
msgid "BrikPanel: WooCommerce Admin Dashboard Theme"
msgstr "BrikPanel : tableau de bord d'administration WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: brikpanel.php
msgid ""
"Beautiful and modern Shopify-style WooCommerce admin panel & dashboard, "
"fully free, forever."
msgstr ""
"Panneau d'administration et tableau de bord WooCommerce modernes et "
"élégants, style Shopify, entièrement gratuits, pour toujours."

