msgstr "Ou charger depuis l'URL d'une image (CDN)"

#: front-end/appearance/brikpanel-appearance.php:633
msgid "Select brand logo"
msgstr "Sélectionner le logo de marque"

#: front-end/appearance/brikpanel-appearance.php:634
